{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTTING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of MOULD unfolds in an alternative industrial version of the Soviet Union at the end of the 1940s. There was no World War II; construction sites are bustling across the USSR, and scientists are diligently working on creating steel builders for a bright future. At one of the mining enterprises, miners come across something unimaginable, and humanity faces a deadly threat. From the depths emerges a parasite \u2014 a creature capable of controlling living organisms, gradually devouring them from within. As it reproduces, it begins to alter the environment, making it more comfortable for itself but unbearable for the planet\u2019s ordinary inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parasite constantly observes every action of the hero. If all enemies are not eliminated on the arena before the alarm signal reaches the parasite, the next battle will be much harder: the number of enemies will increase, and their characteristics will become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO SMOLDERING RUINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a vast region divided into different areas. In each, you must investigate the territory while fighting off the infection. To uncover the secrets of what\u2019s happening, look for worker notes and carefully examine your surroundings. To operate complex mechanisms, you will need a small helper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014The environment conveys the atmosphere of a once-thriving world now in decline\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Large locations accessible through various paths\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014A wide selection of weapons to suit any taste: whether it\u2019s a sharp sickle, a precise rifle, or a chemical sprayer that dissolves anyone daring to stand in your way\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Dynamic difficulty affecting enemy strength and numbers\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Procedural destructibility allowing you to tear enemies apart into pieces\u2014</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821970?t=1768327045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/9ea85c69e5c6c1497537c7f87ed51038ed339693/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768327045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/150084d70cb8d870887d9c5d9cf1159b5fc497eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768327045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/150084d70cb8d870887d9c5d9cf1159b5fc497eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768327045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROTTING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of MOULD unfolds in an alternative industrial version of the Soviet Union at the end of the 1940s. There was no World War II; construction sites are bustling across the USSR, and scientists are diligently working on creating steel builders for a bright future. At one of the mining enterprises, miners come across something unimaginable, and humanity faces a deadly threat. From the depths emerges a parasite \u2014 a creature capable of controlling living organisms, gradually devouring them from within. As it reproduces, it begins to alter the environment, making it more comfortable for itself but unbearable for the planet\u2019s ordinary inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/4348a6abf9ec027ed74a8a4dc3d8a8e8.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parasite constantly observes every action of the hero. If all enemies are not eliminated on the arena before the alarm signal reaches the parasite, the next battle will be much harder: the number of enemies will increase, and their characteristics will become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/f845adc66cfc71c223d43f400fec4ec1.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO SMOLDERING RUINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a vast region divided into different areas. In each, you must investigate the territory while fighting off the infection. To uncover the secrets of what\u2019s happening, look for worker notes and carefully examine your surroundings. To operate complex mechanisms, you will need a small helper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.poster.avif?t=1768327045\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.webm?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/extras/13e82add57b0540d2bdd32f413ecda28.mp4?t=1768327045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014The environment conveys the atmosphere of a once-thriving world now in decline\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Large locations accessible through various paths\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014A wide selection of weapons to suit any taste: whether it\u2019s a sharp sickle, a precise rifle, or a chemical sprayer that dissolves anyone daring to stand in your way\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Dynamic difficulty affecting enemy strength and numbers\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Procedural destructibility allowing you to tear enemies apart into pieces\u2014</p>","developers":["Krol4tka"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821970/4b9ba30a5c32d4e832a83093a042ef1903f93c3f/header.jpg?t=1768327045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong